00:03:31.918 --> 00:03:33.438
Not a fan.

00:03:33.438 --> 00:03:34.390
(laughing)

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.420
- She thinks it was haunted.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.899
I think it was dust, whatever.

00:03:36.899 --> 00:03:38.660
(laughing)

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.440
So ever since this show,
we've been followed

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.408
