00:03:41.408 --> 00:03:42.593
- [Nick] And on that note.

00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:44.290
- So what about you, Jessica?

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.340
What have you been up to?

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.930
- Honestly, you know,
we've all just kinda seen

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:48.820
