way I wanted for it to.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.360
- What you did in confronting
that and doing that

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.610
on a television show like
this takes an incredible

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:09.443
amount of bravery.

00:05:09.443 --> 00:05:10.276
- Thank you.

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.358
- I know we were all
very, very proud of you.

00:05:11.358 --> 00:05:12.810
- [Carlton] Thank you so much.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:13.643
- For doing that.

00:05:13.643 --> 00:05:14.940
- Still processing it, you know.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.307
It's kinda weird sometimes,

00:05:16.307 --> 00:05:19.062
but I'm proud at the end of the day.

00:05:19.062 --> 00:05:23.420
- Damian and Gi, so ya'll are together?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.530
Please dish.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:25.740
