00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.345
I just don't.

00:05:33.345 --> 00:05:34.178
- [Nick] That's awesome.

00:05:34.178 --> 00:05:35.180
- And I didn't.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:39.880
- Okay, so Diamond, how
you been since this show?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:40.713
