00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.436
I'm working on my PhD,

00:05:53.436 --> 00:05:54.780
so I'm going back to school.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.106
- [Nick] Wow, congratulations.

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:56.939
(applauding)

00:05:56.939 --> 00:05:57.927
- Thanks, guys,

00:05:57.927 --> 00:06:01.124
