00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.196
and even judge, and you know,

00:06:09.196 --> 00:06:12.580
we have to really take that all in,

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.280
and also try to be able to cope with it.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.670
- Yes, especially in this day and age,

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:18.580
