00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.030
We'll get to those.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:20.863
- Exactly.

00:06:20.863 --> 00:06:23.210
- Lauren and Cameron, so you guys,

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.330
