married for over a year now.

00:06:40.127 --> 00:06:40.960
- Yeah.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.430
- Trust me, that never stops.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.170
- Well, seriously, never
been as happy as I am

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.370
