00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:51.940
How are you?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:52.773
- I'm good.

00:06:52.773 --> 00:06:55.730
As a man, I think I learned
more about vulnerability,

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.970
communication, and just, I don't know,

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.000
