think it was probable.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.280
I went on this show thinking, you know,

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.330
it's a chance to find love.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.163
Why not?

00:07:25.163 --> 00:07:27.020
Let's see what happens, but.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:29.963
- Yeah, I mean, hey, I was
as skeptical as anyone was

00:07:29.963 --> 00:07:32.700
