you're a stripper.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.053
She was like.

00:07:42.053 --> 00:07:42.953
- Nope.

00:07:42.953 --> 00:07:43.890
(laughing)

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:44.944
- If you would've given
me a second chance.

00:07:44.944 --> 00:07:46.824
(laughing)

00:07:46.824 --> 00:07:47.824
